  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, something that I have been missing dearly as an avatar creator for the game is something that was provided by a mod called freeze frame, it would allow you to create local or global freeze frames of your avatars which acted as a statue of you avatar that froze in whatever pose you were in when hitting the button, this allowed people like myself to setup photoshoots for avatar sale pages by ourselves a feature that is greatly missed as now taking photos is 1000 times more challenging, the mod also allowed you to record and playback a looping animation of your avatar that would follow whatever motions you did while recording. I know this is a little on the niche side of things but this feature would greatly help out all of us content creators, aswell as provide some ways for people to more easily take some great photos",
